<title>GERMANY: TABLE-Moksel books small H1 pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Moksel books small H1 pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		  0.2	  vs 20.9 loss</p>
<p>    Group sales			     1.72 bln   vs 1.67 bln</p>
<p>    (of which domestic)		   1.4  bln   up 2.5 pct</p>
<p>    (of which foreign)		  315.9	  up 4.8 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German meat processing group is Moksel AG.</p>
</text>
